"use strict";(self.webpackChunkwoocommerce_multivendor_marketplace_docs=self.webpackChunkwoocommerce_multivendor_marketplace_docs||[]).push([[390],{9065(e,a,s){s.r(a),s.d(a,{comp:()=>l,data:()=>g});var t=s(641);const n=s.p+"assets/img/vendor-staff-list.6d4dfb45.png",i=s.p+"assets/img/add-vendor-staff.9157aceb.png",d=s.p+"assets/img/edit-vedor-staff-setting.340d2f03.png",r=s.p+"assets/img/allowed-staff-to-do.258f452c.png",o=s.p+"assets/img/allowed-staff-to-do-2.83d2e37c.png",f={},l=(0,s(6262).A)(f,[["render",function(e,a){return(0,t.uX)(),(0,t.CE)("div",null,a[0]||(a[0]=[(0,t.Fv)('<h1 id="vendor-staff" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#vendor-staff"><span>Vendor Staff</span></a></h1><p>The <strong>Vendor Staff</strong> feature allows vendors to add sub-users (store managers) who can log in and manage the store on their behalf. Vendors can grant per-task permissions for each section (view, add, edit, delete, and more) based on the capabilities allowed by the admin.</p><hr><h2 id="managing-vendor-staff" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#managing-vendor-staff"><span>Managing Vendor Staff</span></a></h2><p>Vendors can view a list of all their staff members from the Vendor Dashboard.</p><p><a class="doc-image-link" href="./assets/vendor-staff-list.png"><img src="'+n+'" alt="Vendor Staff List"></a></p><h3 id="adding-a-new-staff-member" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#adding-a-new-staff-member"><span>Adding a New Staff Member</span></a></h3><p>To add a new staff member, click on the <strong>Add Staff</strong> button. Fill in the required details such as Name, Email, and Password.</p><p><a class="doc-image-link" href="./assets/add-vendor-staff.png"><img src="'+i+'" alt="Add Vendor Staff"></a></p><h3 id="editing-staff-settings-and-permissions" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#editing-staff-settings-and-permissions"><span>Editing Staff Settings and Permissions</span></a></h3><p>Vendors can edit existing staff settings and define precise permissions for what the staff member is allowed to do.</p><p><a class="doc-image-link" href="./assets/edit-vedor-staff-setting.png"><img src="'+d+'" alt="Edit Vendor Staff Setting"></a></p><p>The permissions can be granularly controlled per section (e.g., Products, Orders, Profile) and per action (e.g., view, add, edit, delete).</p><p><a class="doc-image-link" href="./assets/allowed-staff-to-do.png"><img src="'+r+'" alt="Allowed Staff Permissions"></a></p><p><a class="doc-image-link" href="./assets/allowed-staff-to-do-2.png"><img src="'+o+'" alt="Allowed Staff Permissions Continued"></a></p><hr><p>This allows vendors to easily scale their operations by delegating tasks to their team members while maintaining strict control over their store&#39;s security and data.</p>',17)]))}]]),g=JSON.parse('{"path":"/documentation/vendor-staff.html","title":"Vendor Staff","lang":"en-US","frontmatter":{},"headers":[{"level":2,"title":"Managing Vendor Staff","slug":"managing-vendor-staff","link":"#managing-vendor-staff","children":[{"level":3,"title":"Adding a New Staff Member","slug":"adding-a-new-staff-member","link":"#adding-a-new-staff-member","children":[]},{"level":3,"title":"Editing Staff Settings and Permissions","slug":"editing-staff-settings-and-permissions","link":"#editing-staff-settings-and-permissions","children":[]}]}],"git":{},"filePathRelative":"documentation/vendor-staff.md"}')}}]);